All set-valued palindrome / central-column / parity-localization
claims hold.  LEM-020's tau <-> 1-tau involution acts on THM-1240's
blocker data as an exact palindrome of choice-sets; the mirror-fixed
column (odd carriers) sits at tau = 1/2 where odd spokes are blocked
by exactly the EVEN pack speeds (depth-1 2-adic layer), and any odd
count of odd-cycle gaps localizes to that column.
